==Description==
The '''Lava Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Lava Nametag''' has orange text with a light orange outline. Orange squares also appear on the nametag, slowly falling down before fading.

